## Enable Omni-Path drivers

{% if is_ubuntu -%}
Ubuntu 24.04 does not currently provide the Omni-Path package set used by the
upstream EL and openEuler recipes. Sites that require Omni-Path should add a
vendor-supported Ubuntu package repository before enabling this optional path in
compute images.
{% else -%}
If your compute resources support Omni-Path, the following commands add OPA
drivers to the chosen compute image.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Add Omni-Path drivers to compute image -->
<!-- ohpc_if_set enable_opa -->
```bash
# Add OPA support and enable
{{ pkg_install_chroot }} opa-basic-tools
{{ pkg_install_chroot }} libpsm2
```
<!-- ohpc_fi -->
<!-- ohpc_end -->
{% endif -%}
